OL,3,GNEWSASuicide prevention campaign
OL,4,Alaunched on beer mats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of beer mats signposting
OL,7,Fpeople to mental health support are
OL,8,Fbeing distributed in pubs, bars and
OL,9,Fcafes in Hereford as part of a suicide
OL,10,Fprevention initiative.
OL,12,FMental health charity, Herefordshire
OL,13,FMind, has produced the mats alongside
OL,14,FHerefordshire Council.
OL,16,FThey are printed with information about
OL,17,Fwhere to get mental health support,
OL,18,Flocally as well as nationally, and
OL,19,Fcontain a QR code to access help on a
OL,20,Fsmartphone.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
