OL,3,GNEWSASuicide prevention campaign
OL,4,Alaunched on beer mats
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's aimed at providing accessible
OL,7,Finformation for people who are
OL,8,Fstruggling with their mental health to
OL,9,Fbe able to find ways that they can
OL,10,Freach out and get help." said CEO of
OL,11,FHerefordshire MIND, Alicia Potter.
